- Jonathan's latest explicit decision outranks living canon; living canon outranks verified code only as specified in `AGENTS.md`.
- Assignment artifacts describe a request at a moment in time. Inspect their status banner and current code before using them.
- Museum folders are historical content, never the next plan.
- Multi-step or Medium/High/Release work uses a worksession.
- Handoffs name exact branch/base/head/PR state, both Dual Course deltas, current commands/results, data/environment impact, uncertainty, and next owner.
- Do not silently rewrite accepted historical decision rows. Add a new living decision when behavior changes.
